---
import LegalLayout from "@/layouts/legal-layout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  canonicalPath="/refund-policy"
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Refund and cancellation policy for Docita subscriptions and add-ons."
  lastUpdated="March 09, 2026"
>
  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">1. Scope</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      This policy applies to paid Docita subscriptions and add-ons purchased
      directly from Docita.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">2. Trial Period</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Eligible plans may include a free trial. Cancel during trial to avoid
      paid billing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">3. Plan Refund Rules</h2>
    <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>Monthly plans are generally non-refundable after billing.</li>
      <li>Annual plans may be reviewed for first-cycle requests within 14 days.</li>
      <li>Usage-based charges and consumed credits are non-refundable.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-foreground">4. How to Request</h2>
    <p class="mt-3">
      Send refund requests to
      <a class="mx-1 text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:billing@docita.work">billing@docita.work</a>
      with clinic name, account email, invoice reference, and reason.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
